cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "IDSS: Intelligent Decision Support System Using Generative AI and Machine Learning"
type: software
version: 1.0.0
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  IDSS turns a business question in plain language and an uploaded table into a verified
  machine-learning model with explained, actionable decisions. LLM agents parse the requirement,
  plan the work and explain the results; a deterministic AutoML engine (scikit-learn, XGBoost,
  LightGBM, Optuna) trains, tunes and verifies the models; a decision layer adds SHAP explanations,
  risk tiers, what-if simulation, recommendations and a PDF report.
keywords:
  - decision support system
  - AutoML
  - large language models
  - multi-agent systems
  - explainable AI
  - SHAP
  - what-if analysis
